   "confidence": "low",
   "notes": "Grand Arcade multi-storey car park (2008), west face on Corn Exchange St. Rusticated grey-buff stone base (~5 m) with a row of small square windows/louvres; Rutland Cycling shop unit with teal fascia at the north (x=0) end. Above, buff stone piers frame tall recessed bays of green-tinted glass panels with steel deck railings at each parking level, plain parapet. Bay count (5) and small-window spacing estimated from oblique 2016 Mapillary views looking north up the street."
